      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她立刻陷入了令我难以置信的疲劳之中。\r\n看来参加奖对她造成的打击，\r\n实在是超乎想象啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8bbafea52bbca4747a4dd55aa342f2a424592936b64b1bb0344707be6b0c3c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
