      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们将这张贵重的抽奖券交给了商店街的大叔。\r\n这样一来……“流向”便不可逆了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a295a0d2985a309eeafd7aec1d1402b26b91c6d8c4edb0bd24a2515f545cc877",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
