      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在学校里，我也会替我母亲干一些类似顾问的工\r\n作。刚刚胜出的那位就是我所指导过的一位学生。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbddab5db5bea4c5fe903faf08125bee758d576f3ec10a91f9683ba538ffb791",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
