      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼前的赛马娘名叫『气槽』。\r\n身为学生会副会长，因其理想高远、实力强大\r\n而被人唤作“女帝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca74c2d5ca7fcb96c30b0ec99ccb075feac2b03a4b654e61b6fb05ceb40d04e4",
